{
  "font_size": 0.4,
  "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
  "background_alpha": 0.5,
  "background_color": "#9C27B0",
  "Stroke": "none",
  "type": "AIsubtitle",
  "lang": "en",
  "version": "v1.7.0.4",
  "body": [
    {
      "from": 0.08,
      "to": 2.0,
      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Here we are at the largest nuclear weapons facility in the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 2.0,
      "to": 3.24,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the home of PTX",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 3.24,
      "to": 4.96,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "along the historic Route 66, which passes through a population of 200,000",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 4.96,
      "to": 6.24,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "in the small Texas city of Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 6.24,
      "to": 8.22,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "though the downtown streets are completely empty",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 8.22,
      "to": 10.86,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Amarillo is the largest city in the Texas Panhandle region",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 10.86,
      "to": 13.18,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "an area comprising the 26 most northwestern counties of Texas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 13.18,
      "to": 14.96,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which can be considered the most desolate part of Texas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 14.96,
      "to": 17.1,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with an area roughly comparable to the Ningxia Hui Autonomous Region",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 17.1,
      "to": 19.02,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the total population is less than 430,000",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 19.02,
      "to": 21.46,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with 72% of them living in and around Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 21.46,
      "to": 22.16,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the small town area",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 22.16,
      "to": 23.78,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, the largest employer in the region",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 23.78,
      "to": 25.56,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "PANTX with 4,600 employees",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 25.56,
      "to": 28.36,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "along with some oil and ranching companies, are all located around the town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 28.36,
      "to": 29.52,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although the data shows",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 29.52,
      "to": 31.16,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that the town's population is growing",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 31.16,
      "to": 33.3,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "why does the city center look like a ghost town?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 33.3,
      "to": 34.66,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You won’t see a soul out in broad daylight",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 34.66,
      "to": 36.44,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can stroll down the streets as you please",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 36.44,
      "to": 37.62,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This has led to the hollowing out of downtown areas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 37.62,
      "to": 40.16,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The main reason is that office and residential areas are separated in the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 41.78,
      "to": 43.26,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most people are on vacation at home",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 43.26,
      "to": 44.9,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Add to that the widespread use of cars in America",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 44.9,
      "to": 47.29,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "All new commercial developments are along the highways",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 47.29,
      "to": 49.67,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Declining city centers are not unique to Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 49.67,
      "to": 51.49,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I’m now driving through Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 51.49,
      "to": 52.66,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On Interstate 40",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 52.66,
      "to": 54.12,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "both sides used to be wasteland",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 54.12,
      "to": 55.4,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are abundant land resources",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 55.4,
      "to": 57.3,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the cost of developing the land on both sides of the highway is low",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 57.3,
      "to": 59.58,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's quite surprising that a small city of 200,000 can have such a wide highway",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 59.58,
      "to": 60.92,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which is quite characteristic of Texas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 60.92,
      "to": 62.38,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and right next to this highway is a place called",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 62.38,
      "to": 63.96,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Texas Steak Ranch, a farm-to-table experience",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 63.96,
      "to": 65.8,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "here, there are noticeably more people than in the city center",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 65.8,
      "to": 67.59,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The parking lot here is also huge.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 67.59,
      "to": 68.55,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Apart from the front row,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 68.55,
      "to": 70.53,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are dedicated spots for trucks at the back.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 70.53,
      "to": 72.05,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This complex has more than just restaurants,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 72.05,
      "to": 73.49,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it also comes with a motel.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 73.49,
      "to": 76.43,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In a way, it’s quite like a Texas-themed amusement park.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 76.43,
      "to": 78.87,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although the motel looks colorful from the outside,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 78.87,
      "to": 79.63,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "once you go inside,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 79.63,
      "to": 82.46,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it’s not much different from most of the other motels I’ve stayed in.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 82.46,
      "to": 83.5,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I don't actually live here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 83.5,
      "to": 84.94,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I just slipped in to take a photo while cleaning the guest room",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 84.94,
      "to": 86.18,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The room looks pretty tidy inside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 86.18,
      "to": 88.24,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A night here costs $80",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 88.24,
      "to": 89.7,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm not sure if it's worth it or not",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 89.7,
      "to": 90.9,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This huge yellow house across from the car hotel is the steakhouse",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 90.9,
      "to": 93.24,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It makes sense to have a steakhouse in Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 93.24,
      "to": 94.26,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The steakhouse is inside",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 94.26,
      "to": 96.44,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Opening a steakhouse in Amarillo is actually quite fitting",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 96.44,
      "to": 97.98,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are many animal farms in this area",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 97.98,
      "to": 99.22,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a quarter of the beef in the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 99.22,
      "to": 101.0,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is produced around Amarillo",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 101.0,
      "to": 102.78,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the most famous thing about this steakhouse is the 72-ounce",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 102.78,
      "to": 104.64,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which is a 2-kilogram steak challenge",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 104.64,
      "to": 106.2,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "finish this steak within an hour",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 106.2,
      "to": 108.68,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "along with the complimentary bread, salad, and potatoes, and your meal is free",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 108.68,
      "to": 110.52,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "long-time viewers know I have a pretty big appetite",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 110.52,
      "to": 112.18,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I was indeed planning to take on the challenge",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 112.18,
      "to": 113.68,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But today, Thanksgiving is packed.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 113.68,
      "to": 114.36,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There’s even a queue.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 114.36,
      "to": 114.92,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let me think about it.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 114.92,
      "to": 116.64,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I don’t want to cause any trouble for the staff.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 116.64,
      "to": 119.17,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The main reason is that they have a special Thanksgiving lunch here today.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 119.17,
      "to": 120.77,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It’s pretty much typical white American fare.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 120.77,
      "to": 122.44,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Similar to what you’d get in a U.S. college cafeteria.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 122.44,
      "to": 123.36,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To be honest, I don’t quite understand.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 123.36,
      "to": 125.16,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Why so many people bring their families to wait in line for a meal.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 125.16,
      "to": 127.2,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This might be to get a feel for the festive atmosphere.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.2,
      "to": 128.93,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It costs $35 per person.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 128.93,
      "to": 130.21,
      "sid": 75,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If it were only $3.50,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 130.21,
      "to": 131.79,
      "sid": 76,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I might consider waiting in line.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 131.79,
      "to": 133.01,
      "sid": 77,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even though I didn’t spend any money here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 133.01,
      "to": 134.91,
      "sid": 78,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the staff are all quite friendly.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 134.91,
      "to": 136.21,
      "sid": 79,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wandered around taking footage,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 136.21,
      "to": 137.28,
      "sid": 80,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and everyone was very welcoming.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 137.28,
      "to": 137.84,
      "sid": 81,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To be honest",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 137.84,
      "to": 139.56,
      "sid": 82,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Shooting videos in these remote areas in America",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 139.56,
      "to": 140.86,
      "sid": 83,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there really isn’t much good food",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 140.86,
      "to": 143.02,
      "sid": 84,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "fortunately, I always carry this multi-grain shake",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 143.02,
      "to": 144.1,
      "sid": 85,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it really fills me up",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 144.1,
      "to": 145.1,
      "sid": 86,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and takes care of my gut",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 145.1,
      "to": 147.2,
      "sid": 87,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it directly solves my problem of irregular eating habits",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.2,
      "to": 147.68,
      "sid": 88,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "experts say",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.68,
      "to": 149.34,
      "sid": 89,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "we should consume 1/2 cup of mixed beans daily",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 149.34,
      "to": 152.34,
      "sid": 90,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but usually, people consume refined soybeans and flour",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 152.34,
      "to": 154.46,
