      "content": "Now I'm 33 minutes west of Amarillo, in a town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 478.49,
      "to": 480.92,
      "sid": 275,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "called Vega, with a population of 879",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 480.92,
      "to": 483.06,
      "sid": 276,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which was originally on the old Route 66",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 483.06,
      "to": 484.46,
      "sid": 277,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but now the motels here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 484.46,
      "to": 486.15,
      "sid": 278,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "along with gas stations and the like, have all closed down",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 486.15,
      "to": 488.07,
      "sid": 279,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the locals here mainly raise cattle and the like",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 488.07,
      "to": 491.039,
      "sid": 280,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or set up a few wind turbines on your own land",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 491.039,
      "to": 493.239,
      "sid": 281,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Texas leads the pack in wind power generation",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 493.239,
      "to": 494.94,
      "sid": 282,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "compared to the other 49 states in the U.S.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 494.94,
      "to": 497.76,
      "sid": 283,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The wind energy produced in Texas could meet the annual electricity needs of four superpowers",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 497.76,
      "to": 498.46,
      "sid": 284,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "outside of China, the U.S.,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 498.46,
      "to": 499.56,
      "sid": 285,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Germany, and India,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 499.56,
      "to": 502.12,
      "sid": 286,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "as well as the rest of the world's countries",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 502.12,
      "to": 502.92,
      "sid": 287,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In this area,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 502.92,
      "to": 506.53,
      "sid": 288,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's common to see scenes of cattle grazing alongside wind turbines",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 506.53,
      "to": 507.81,
      "sid": 289,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "From here, head north all the way.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 507.81,
      "to": 510.27,
      "sid": 290,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There’s also a troubled youth center in the wilderness here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 510.27,
      "to": 511.25,
      "sid": 291,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Boys Ranch",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 511.25,
      "to": 512.29,
      "sid": 292,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As you drive further north,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 512.29,
      "to": 513.11,
      "sid": 293,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the landscape becomes drier.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 513.11,
      "to": 514.25,
      "sid": 294,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Without irrigation equipment,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 514.25,
      "to": 515.89,
      "sid": 295,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it’s impossible to grow crops.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 515.89,
      "to": 517.47,
      "sid": 296,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So the land here is less valuable.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 517.47,
      "to": 518.23,
      "sid": 297,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In 1939,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 518.23,
      "to": 520.27,
      "sid": 298,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A former professional wrestler named Fly",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 520.27,
      "to": 522.299,
      "sid": 299,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "has leased a large piece of land on this hill",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 522.299,
      "to": 523.419,
      "sid": 300,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to build a small town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 523.419,
      "to": 525.779,
      "sid": 301,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "for children who can't attend regular schools due to behavioral or family issues",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 525.779,
      "to": 527.9,
      "sid": 302,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because they have problems at home or with their behavior",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 527.9,
      "to": 530.18,
      "sid": 303,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "apart from the teachers and troubled children",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 530.18,
      "to": 531.24,
      "sid": 304,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are no other residents in the town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 531.24,
      "to": 532.34,
      "sid": 305,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Today is Thanksgiving break",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 532.34,
      "to": 533.4,
      "sid": 306,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and everyone has left",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 533.4,
      "to": 535.18,
      "sid": 307,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm here today to show you all",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 535.18,
      "to": 537.32,
      "sid": 308,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "what a town looks like when all its residents have vanished.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 537.32,
      "to": 539.96,
      "sid": 309,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Once humans leave, the original inhabitants of the land come out.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 539.96,
      "to": 542.2,
      "sid": 310,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many deer are grazing in the children's park.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 542.2,
      "to": 544.72,
      "sid": 311,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Perhaps this is what the world will look like if humans disappear in the future.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 544.72,
      "to": 545.24,
      "sid": 312,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This question.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 545.24,
      "to": 548.18,
      "sid": 313,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The children's center in the town is usually open for visits to the school.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 548.18,
      "to": 550.04,
      "sid": 314,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most of the small houses here are libraries.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 550.04,
      "to": 551.11,
      "sid": 315,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and other buildings like classrooms.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 551.11,
      "to": 553.25,
      "sid": 316,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right in the center, there’s also a post office and a fire station.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 553.25,
      "to": 554.63,
      "sid": 317,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Beyond the core area of the town,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 554.63,
      "to": 555.91,
      "sid": 318,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are outdoor activities,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 555.91,
      "to": 557.07,
      "sid": 319,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like horseback riding and fishing.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 557.07,
      "to": 559.43,
      "sid": 320,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "While it feels a bit similar to that mental hospital in Florida I visited before,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 559.43,
      "to": 560.589,
      "sid": 321,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I still quite fancy coming here for school.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 560.589,
      "to": 562.809,
      "sid": 322,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wandered around this town for half an hour,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 562.809,
      "to": 564.589,
      "sid": 323,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the only person I saw was a guy who came here to fish.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 564.589,
      "to": 567.35,
      "sid": 324,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The only person I saw was an old guy who came here to fish.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 567.35,
      "to": 568.83,
      "sid": 325,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Leaving the Problem Children Town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 568.83,
      "to": 571.84,
      "sid": 326,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Continuing north to a town called Channing with a population of 481",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 571.84,
      "to": 573.82,
      "sid": 327,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The land feels increasingly barren on both sides",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 573.82,
      "to": 577.36,
      "sid": 328,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm currently in Hartley County, which borders New Mexico",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 577.36,
      "to": 578.64,
      "sid": 329,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This area can already be considered",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 578.64,
      "to": 580.7,
      "sid": 330,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a mix of grassland and desert",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 580.7,
      "to": 582.94,
      "sid": 331,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "No wonder the road leads into the town for the cattle to graze",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 582.94,
      "to": 584.52,
      "sid": 332,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now I'm entering the town of Frontlin",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 584.52,
      "to": 585.62,
      "sid": 333,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Here in the late 19th century",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 585.62,
      "to": 586.3,
      "sid": 334,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it used to be",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 586.3,
      "to": 588.82,
      "sid": 335,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a ranch company about twice the size of Shanghai",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 588.82,
      "to": 590.77,
      "sid": 336,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the headquarters of the XIT Ranch",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 590.77,
      "to": 593.45,
      "sid": 337,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After the ranch company went bankrupt in 1911",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 593.45,
      "to": 595.09,
      "sid": 338,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the town declined as well",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 595.09,
      "to": 597.65,
      "sid": 339,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now Channing is more like a roadside supply station",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 597.65,
      "to": 600.41,
      "sid": 340,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, there are occasionally large trucks passing through this town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 600.41,
      "to": 602.54,
      "sid": 341,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "All the businesses here are run by Mexicans",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 602.54,
      "to": 603.76,
      "sid": 342,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even though today is Thanksgiving",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 603.76,
      "to": 605.54,
      "sid": 343,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the Mexican owner told me",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 605.54,
      "to": 606.44,
      "sid": 344,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he has no wife or children",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 606.44,
      "to": 608.56,
      "sid": 345,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "running this store alone in such a remote place",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 608.56,
      "to": 610.21,
      "sid": 346,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it doesn’t really matter whether it’s a holiday or not",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 610.21,
      "to": 612.83,
      "sid": 347,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I took the opportunity to buy a Mexican burrito from him",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 612.83,
      "to": 614.53,
      "sid": 348,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are actually quite a few drivers passing through here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 614.53,
      "to": 616.18,
      "sid": 349,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "most of them look like they are from Latin America",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 616.18,
      "to": 617.58,
      "sid": 350,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "These hollowed-out American rural areas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 617.58,
      "to": 619.1,
      "sid": 351,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "would be even more desolate without these Mexicans holding them up",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 619.1,
      "to": 620.98,
      "sid": 352,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The current situation would definitely be even more bleak",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 620.98,
      "to": 623.44,
      "sid": 353,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Apart from this Mexican store in Submarine Town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 623.44,
      "to": 624.5,
      "sid": 354,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the newer-looking buildings",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 624.5,
      "to": 625.62,
      "sid": 355,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and this old church",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 625.62,
      "to": 627.9,
      "sid": 356,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I imagine the locals have put in a lot of effort to maintain it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 627.9,
      "to": 628.58,
      "sid": 357,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In addition",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 628.58,
      "to": 630.7,
      "sid": 358,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there’s a row of huge grain silos to the north of the town",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 630.7,
      "to": 632.859,
      "sid": 359,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They look quite impressive as you pass by",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 632.859,
      "to": 634.579,
      "sid": 360,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This part of Texas is much more primitive compared to places like Dallas",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 634.579,
      "to": 636.379,
      "sid": 361,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and Houston",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 636.379,
      "to": 637.939,
      "sid": 362,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wonder what you all think about it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 637.939,
      "to": 639.459,
      "sid": 363,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's it for this video",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 639.459,
      "to": 642.42,
      "sid": 364,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Follow me to explore more places that ordinary people don’t usually visit",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    }
  ]
